{"data": [{"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-11-04T20:38:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118080445086584834"], "id": "2118080445086584834", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2383, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "NASA’s Neil Gehrels Swift Observatory plummeted back into Earth’s atmosphere Wednesday over Western Indonesia, ending nearly 22 years in orbit for the gamma-ray burst hunter after a failed attempt to rescue it. https://t.co/7djq9IHksY https://t.co/VUR9sYzdJW", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2118080445086584834"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T20:02:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118071418982117399"], "id": "2118071418982117399", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 815, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118045927831224645", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Actually several of those are clearly wild outliers-- Harvard-Harris seems to be the actually nutty one: they didn't even poll DeSantis, and turn up huge Trump Jr. numbers. Pretty suss? https://t.co/wqHxPnHE79", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118071418982117399"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T20:01:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118071097128362310"], "id": "2118071097128362310", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 804, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118054655443747310", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "i do want to see a head-to-head of Kalshi, Polymarket, and major polling models, ideally using like a harmonized average of their forecasts on August 1, September 1, October 1, and November 1. https://t.co/PSQOOF0c3a", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118071097128362310"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T19:44:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118066838550499551"], "id": "2118066838550499551", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1249, "like_count": 29, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117976583642534110", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "one thing young men do not like is being condescended to https://t.co/NOoL7MqQTz", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118066838550499551"}, {"author_id": "19355829", "created_at": "2026-11-04T18:52:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118053846735876343"], "id": "2118053846735876343", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 22, "impression_count": 14575, "like_count": 223, "quote_count": 18, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 38}, "text": "Space Force reports SWIFT reentered at 1239 UTC Nov 4 over 99 deg E, 3 deg N over Northern Sumatra", "url": "https://x.com/planet4589/status/2118053846735876343"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T18:44:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118051736669823159"], "id": "2118051736669823159", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1957, "like_count": 87, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118048994802729457", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "YES.\n\nVoters want this. Drain the swamp. https://t.co/wb9zauLShQ", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118051736669823159"}, {"author_id": "6374602", "created_at": "2026-11-04T18:27:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118047558333542783"], "id": "2118047558333542783", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1611, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118045404529115216", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Even minor league baseball teams are becoming space unicorns. https://t.co/VthppzCnTL", "url": "https://x.com/jeff_foust/status/2118047558333542783"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T18:19:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118045546212454677"], "id": "2118045546212454677", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2921, "like_count": 107, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 6}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118041062166163804", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I'm not sure this is true.\n1) Nothing House/Senate can do right now will actually stop Trump from continuing to deport as DHS likes\n2) If Democrats respond with a return to Biden mass immigration peaks, I suspect anti-immigrant politics returns a GOP majority very fast https://t.co/Rqj8Ew2nEX", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118045546212454677"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-11-04T18:01:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118041009766678695"], "id": "2118041009766678695", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 17, "impression_count": 219629, "like_count": 395, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 35, "retweet_count": 53}, "text": "Earlier today, @astro_anil spoke from the International Space Station with @MarkRober, taking questions from students about life in space. Tune in: https://t.co/RkemqsKYNg https://t.co/XdZymV11nh", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2118041009766678695"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:50:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118038207757701285"], "id": "2118038207757701285", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 4269, "like_count": 64, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117898995662000474", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Who she would we blame?\n\nRight, the official who spearheaded every actual foreign policy success the administration has had\n\nBut never our hapless drunk WARRIOR secretary who pushed for a war with zero plan https://t.co/wmGiwG7tiv", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118038207757701285"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:40:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118035579334193507"], "id": "2118035579334193507", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1234, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118016087224983872", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "corruption and cost of living\n\n(and cost of living includes gas prices, which is Iran war in a gas price trenchcoat) https://t.co/vBwGdGwSyx", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118035579334193507"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:34:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118034216503955710"], "id": "2118034216503955710", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 36, "impression_count": 202343, "like_count": 848, "quote_count": 19, "reply_count": 61, "retweet_count": 98}, "text": "Join us for @astro_anil and @astro_kutryk’s next spacewalk!\n\nTune in here on Nov. 5 at 8:30am ET (1330 UTC) to watch the astronauts install and deploy the second of two new solar arrays on the @Space_Station. https://t.co/a1V5ciNgfD", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2118034216503955710"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:27:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118032440002265326"], "id": "2118032440002265326", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 1340, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117867437442179453", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "America will not tolerate higher cost of living. https://t.co/Jr0VocNcI1", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118032440002265326"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:26:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118032211404591303"], "id": "2118032211404591303", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1873, "like_count": 30, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118021667301503031", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I read it more specifically as throwing Pete Hegseth under the bus. https://t.co/gdtZEIyD2c", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118032211404591303"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:17:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118029836622913536"], "id": "2118029836622913536", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1561, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118002438485766384", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "but hey, we gained 2 points with the 65+ crowd https://t.co/HktivUnmWp", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118029836622913536"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:12:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118028593682874588"], "id": "2118028593682874588", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 6594, "like_count": 103, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "The only plausible path to victory in Iran is massive nuclear weapon use on civilian population centers followed by a demand for total regime change or else millions more will die. This is what we actually did to Japan. This strategy works.\n\nBut we should not do this. Which means", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118028593682874588"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:06:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118027032181502457"], "id": "2118027032181502457", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 3611, "like_count": 34, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2110149942727553187", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "when i first saw this add, i assumed it was for a Republican https://t.co/muFODf8SW0", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118027032181502457"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T17:01:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118025830366695597"], "id": "2118025830366695597", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1341, "like_count": 45, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117985945840763272", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Corruption is a big issue!\n\nI'll say that for me personally, worries about this issue impacted my family's conversation about who we would vote for. \n\nThe fact that GOP electeds are not seeking penalties against obviously corrupt officials is nuts! https://t.co/nwi5PxHOIF", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118025830366695597"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T16:30:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118018169658843372"], "id": "2118018169658843372", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 5097, "like_count": 329, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 32}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118016068837101726", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Sanders-endorsed candidates outperformed 2024 Democratic shares by about 5-6%.\n\nNon-Sanders-endorsed candidates outperformed 2024 Democratic shares by about 14%.\n\nPeople voted against Trump. They very much did not vote for the DSA. https://t.co/BO8oMC4De5", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118018169658843372"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T16:27:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118017185444663430"], "id": "2118017185444663430", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 3463, "like_count": 50, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118004988433641835", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Vance clearly wants the admin to learn the lesson of this election.\n\nWe will know if he is successful at pushing for that learning if, and only if, the tariffs get repealed.\n\nThat's the only direct and immediate cost of living lever the administration has on hand. https://t.co/rPMDtb0bkS", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2118017185444663430"}, {"author_id": "19355829", "created_at": "2026-11-04T16:18:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118015109637255432"], "id": "2118015109637255432", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 7274, "like_count": 110, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 15}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117922772550926526", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Over 2 hrs after the end of the window, no updated data from US Space Force yet. SWIFT's low orbital inclination means sensor coverage of it is not the greatest https://t.co/gvHIgGqvdS", "url": "https://x.com/planet4589/status/2118015109637255432"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:09:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117967572360462399"], "id": "2117967572360462399", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1316, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117958587163025729", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "(No) https://t.co/Tx6FPUOLdt", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117967572360462399"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:01:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117965434201022504"], "id": "2117965434201022504", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1760, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117829229777981633", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I mean he’s not wrong https://t.co/1evUmjCYaJ", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117965434201022504"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:46:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117961737383362952"], "id": "2117961737383362952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1593, "like_count": 38, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117941804045578529", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Checks out tbh https://t.co/qucUPYi808", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117961737383362952"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:43:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117960939878408412"], "id": "2117960939878408412", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 8618, "like_count": 210, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 14}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117830475964154096", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Buckle up boys, Trump’s historically disastrous second term probably hands the Democrats the Supreme Court. https://t.co/7KLB3EReLU", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117960939878408412"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "17217640", "name": "Spaceflight Now", "username": "SpaceflightNow"}, {"id": "626660983", "name": "Lyman Stone 石來民 🦬🦬🦬", "username": "lymanstoneky"}, {"id": "19355829", "name": "Jonathan McDowell", "username": "planet4589"}, {"id": "6374602", "name": "Jeff Foust", "username": "jeff_foust"}, {"id": "11348282", "name": "NASA", "username": "NASA"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2118080445086584834", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyioa3laxh7zwp5dr6zj4x13ekd", "oldest_id": "2117960939878408412", "result_count": 25}}
